  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Delbetalning till DFA (Irland)-revision av CSF</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Partial payment to DFA (Irish) - CSF Audit - Partial payment for CSF Audit</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">As fund manager under a DfID contract, Deloitte is responsible for the audit of the Civil Society Fund and Partership Fund for the period July 2012 to January 2014. PwC was procured using the Irish Aid framework agreement. Sweden as one of the ADPs agreed to top up the budget with &#xa3;5,308 to ensure that the exercise is handled expeditiously. Sweden is expected to pay this amount to Irish Aid for onward payment to PwC, from the allocation earlier intended for the CSF. Given that the activity period for the Swedish support to the CSF has expired, a formal decision is required to enable this payment to be made.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">PLEASE REVIEW YOUR ANSWER AS THE QUESTION HAS BEEN CHANGED

Det h&#xe4;r &#xe4;r en samfinansiering av kostnaden f&#xf6;r revision av CSF som &#xf6;verenskommits mellan Sida, DFID och Irish Aid.</narrative>
  </description>
